# Biscuit, found at last (The Missing Cat). Format: dialogue/dialogue_parser.gd
@speaker Biscuit

== offer ==
MEWO.
Biscuit looks at you, then at your shoes, then at you again.
> Pick him up. -> carried [set cat_found]
> Leave him be. -> leave

== carried ==
[wave]Purrrr.[/wave]
Time to take him home.

== leave ==
[i]meow[/i]
